MODULE: ExclusiveTurnTimerAdmitsExclusiveCall
TARGET: ExclusiveTurn
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a timer takes a call turn without dequeuing the waiting call
PERTURBS: TimerFire

--- FIND
TimerFire(g) ==
    /\ timer[g] = "new" /\ turn[g] = "idle" /\ ~queued[g]
    /\ turn' = HoldTurn(g, "timer")
    /\ timer' = [timer EXCEPT ![g] = "fired"]
    /\ UNCHANGED <<queued, served, operation, age>>
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: a timer takes a call turn without dequeuing the waiting call
TimerFire(g) ==
    /\ timer[g] = "new" /\ turn[g] = "idle"
    /\ turn' = HoldTurn(g, "call")
    /\ timer' = [timer EXCEPT ![g] = "fired"]
    /\ UNCHANGED <<queued, served, operation, age>>
--- END
